{
  "name": "UMKM 05 — Form Order (Google Form) → Notifikasi + Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "mode": "everyMinute"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Form Responses 1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Ada Isi Form Baru",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "GANTI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets UMKM"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ambil semua field dari form (nama kolom dinamis)\nconst j = $json;\nconst skip = ['Timestamp', 'Waktu', 'Nomor'];\n\nlet isi = '';\nfor (const [k, v] of Object.entries(j)) {\n  if (skip.some(s => k.toLowerCase().includes(s.toLowerCase()))) continue;\n  isi += '*' + k + ':* ' + (v || '-') + '\\n';\n}\n\nconst nama = j['Nama'] || j['Nama Lengkap'] || j['Name'] || 'Pelanggan';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    notif: '📩 *ORDER BARU DARI FORM*\\n\\nDari: ' + nama + '\\n\\n' + isi + '\\nSegera ditindaklanjuti!',\n    nama: nama,\n    isi_lengkap: isi\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "format",
      "name": "Format Notifikasi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.fonnte.com/send",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "target",
              "value": "GANTI_NOMOR_WA_ADMIN"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.notif }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Notifikasi WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        220
      ],
      "notes": "Token Fonnte dari dashboard fonnte.com -> Device -> Token. Ganti GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.fonnte.com/send",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "target",
              "value": "GANTI_NOMOR_WA_ADMIN"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=🔔 *ORDER BARU*\n\nNama: {{ $json.nama }}\n\n{{ $json.isi_lengkap }}\n\n_Balas sekarang sebelum kabur._"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send2",
      "name": "Notifikasi Admin (WhatsApp)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        420
      ],
      "notes": "Token Fonnte dari dashboard fonnte.com -> Device -> Token. Ganti GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UMKM 05 — Google Form → Notifikasi\n\n**Cara pakai:**\n1. Bikin Google Form order (Nama, No HP, Produk, Alamat, dll)\n2. Link ke Google Sheet (Responses → Link to Sheets)\n3. Ganti `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID` dengan ID sheet itu\n4. Aktifkan workflow\n\n**Hasil:**\nSetiap ada yang isi form → lo dapat notifikasi WhatsApp dalam **1 menit**.\n\n**Kenapa ini worth buat client:**\n- Google Form gratis, gak perlu website\n- Order masuk langsung kabar, gak perlu cek sheet manual\n- Bisa 2 notifikasi: grup + admin pribadi\n\n**Yang diedit:**\n- `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID`\n- `GANTI_NOMOR_WA_ADMIN` (grup/channel)\n- `GANTI_NOMOR_WA_ADMIN` (HP lo)",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
